{"data":{"__type":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"DiscussionThread","description":"A discussion thread within a community.\nA discussion is created by a user and consists of an original post\n(with a mandatory title) and zero or more replies.\n\nImplements DiscussionCommon interface for common post fields.","fields":[{"name":"author","description":"The author of this discussion.\nReturns a placeholder \"[deleted user]\" representation if the author's\naccount has been deleted.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"DiscussionAuthor","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"availabilityStatusInfo","description":"Availability status for this discussion, with the community's status taken into account.\nDetermines visibility and whether its content can be created or changed.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"DiscussionThreadAvailabilityStatusInfo","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"body","description":"Body content of the discussion with rich text formatting (bold, italics, indent).\nNull if the discussion was created without body content and the post is not in a removed state.\nWhen status is DELETED, REJECTED, or REMOVED_BY_ADMIN, returns localized placeholder text\nappropriate to the viewer (e.g. author sees detailed reason, public sees null or generic text).","args":[],"type":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"Markdown","ofType":null},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"canDelete","description":"Whether the current viewer can delete this post as a customer action.\n\nReturns true if the viewer is the post author (deleting their own discussion).\n\nReturns false if:\n- The viewer is not authenticated\n- The viewer is not the author\n- The post has already been deleted\n\nNote: This field does NOT reflect moderator capability. Moderators delete any\ndiscussion via moderateDeleteDiscussion, gated by\nDiscussionCommunity.viewerModerationPermissions. A moderator viewing another\nuser's post sees canDelete = false; a moderator viewing their own post sees\ncanDelete = true (their author self-delete).\n\nUsed by the client to conditionally render the customer \"Delete\" action.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Boolean","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"containsSpoilers","description":"Whether the post body contains spoilers.\nWhen true, the client should obfuscate the body content and show a\n\"spoiler\" label with a reveal CTA.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Boolean","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"createdTime","description":"Timestamp of when this discussion was created, in ISO-8601 format.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"DateTime","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"entityMentions","description":"IMDb entity mentions (titles and names) referenced in this discussion.\nBounded list; maximum 100 mentions per post.\nThe 'after' parameter is not available because pagination is not supported.\nReturns a Connection type to wrap the total count and provide future flexibility.\n@throws GRAPHQL_VALIDATION_FAILED if first greater than 100.","args":[{"name":"first","description":"Maximum number of mentions to return (max 100).","defaultValue":null,"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Int","ofType":null}}}],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"EntityMentionConnection","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"id","description":"Unique identifier for the discussion.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"ID","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"interest","description":"Interest tagged for this discussion thread.\nNon-null for all interest-tagged discussion threads.\nNull when no interest is associated (e.g., future discussion types such as Video\nthat may not have an interest tagged).","args":[],"type":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"Interest","ofType":null},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"isEdited","description":"Whether this discussion has been edited since creation.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Boolean","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"isFeatured","description":"Whether this discussion is pinned as staff-featured.\nFeatured discussions appear near the top of the feed (after sponsored content).","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Boolean","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"isSponsored","description":"Whether this discussion contains sponsored content.\nSponsored discussions always appear first in the feed.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Boolean","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"lastUpdated","description":"Timestamp of the most recent edit in ISO-8601 format.\nNull if the discussion has never been edited.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"DateTime","ofType":null},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"latestReplyTime","description":"Timestamp of the most recent reply across all levels in this discussion.\nNull if no replies exist.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"DateTime","ofType":null},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"replies","description":"Paginated list of top-level replies to the original post.\nDefault ordering: chronological, oldest first.\nMaximum 100 replies can be requested at a time.\nSorting inputs are not currently supported but will be added in future.\n@throws GRAPHQL_VALIDATION_FAILED if first greater than 100.","args":[{"name":"after","description":"Cursor for pagination - ID of the last item from previous page.","defaultValue":null,"type":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"ID","ofType":null}},{"name":"first","description":"Number of replies to return (max 100).","defaultValue":null,"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Int","ofType":null}}}],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"DiscussionReplyConnection","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"replyCount","description":"Total number of direct replies to this discussion.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"SCALAR","name":"Int","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"replyStatusInfo","description":"Reply status for this discussion.\nDetermines whether new replies can be created. Existing replies remain visible.\n\nSuperseded by availabilityStatusInfo; will be removed once clients migrate.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"DiscussionThreadReplyStatusInfo","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"status","description":"Publication status of this discussion post.\nAll child replies remain visible regardless of status.","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"ENUM","name":"DiscussionPostStatus","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"title","description":"The title of this discussion.\nWhen status is DELETED, REJECTED, or REMOVED_BY_ADMIN, returns localized placeholder text\nappropriate to the viewer (e.g. author sees removal reason, public sees generic removal text).","args":[],"type":{"kind":"NON_NULL","name":null,"ofType":{"kind":"OBJECT","name":"Markdown","ofType":null}},"isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null}],"inputFields":null,"interfaces":[{"kind":"INTERFACE","name":